i','More Info'=>'Batafsil','More information about migrating to v6 can be found %s.'=>'V6 ga oʻtish haqida batafsil ma’lumotni %s topasiz.','Most of an event held at once (%)'=>'Tadbirning bir vaqtda ushlab turiladigan eng katta qismi (%)','Moving from %s?'=>'%s dan o‘tmoqchimisiz?','Multi Line'=>'Bir necha qator','Multi Site Options'=>'Multi Site parametrlari','MultiSite options have moved <a href="%s">here</a>. <a href="%s">Dismiss message</a>'=>'MultiSite parametrlari <a href="%s">bu yerga</a> koʻchirildi. <a href="%s">Xabarni yopish</a>','Multiple Timeslots'=>'Bir nechta vaqt oraligʻi','Multiple dots'=>'Bir nechta nuqta','Multiple file uploads are not allowed'=>'Bir nechta fayl yuklashga ruxsat berilmaydi','Multisite Settings'=>'Multisayt sozlamalari','My %s'=>'Mening %s','My Bookings'=>'Mening bronlarim','My Bookings messages'=>'Mening bronlarim xabarlari','My Event Bookings'=>'Mening tadbir bronlarim','My Events'=>'Mening tadbirlarim','My Locations'=>'Mening joylashuvlarim','My Profile'=>'Mening profilim','My bookings'=>'Mening bronlarim','My bookings page'=>'Mening bronlarim sahifasi','N/A'=>'Mavjud emas','Name'=>'Nomi','Name: %s'=>'Ism: %s','Near...'=>'Yaqinida...','Need event-specific cancellation settings or support for hours after an event started? This is included in our %s.'=>'Tadbirga xos bekor qilish sozlamalari yoki tadbir boshlangandan keyingi soatlarni qoʻllab-quvvatlash kerakmi? Bu bizning %s ga kiritilgan.','Needs Attention'=>'Eʼtibor talab qiladi','New %s'=>'Yangi %s','New %s Name'=>'Yangi %s nomi','New Archetype'=>'Yangi arxetip','New Event'=>'Yangi tadbir','New Event Category Name'=>'Yangi tadbir bo\'limi nomi','New Event Tag Name'=>'Yangi tadbir kalit so\'zi nomi','New Location'=>'Yangi joylashuv','New Repeating Event'=>'Yangi takrorlanuvchi tadbir','New booking received'=>'Yangi bron qabul qilindi','New bookings'=>'Yangi bronlar','New events'=>'Yangi tadbirlar','New user registration on your blog %s:'=>'%s blogingizda yangi foydalanuvchi roʻ